        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Deep Purple\n- Places: Hertford\n- Products: 24 Carat Purple\n- Concepts: compilation albums, hard rock, civil parishes, population\n\nFacts:\n- Deep Purple are an English rock band that formed in Hertford in 1968.\n- Hertford forms a civil parish.\n- The 2011 census put the population of Hertford at about 26,000.\n- 24 Carat Purple is a compilation album by the hard rock band Deep Purple.\n- 24 Carat Purple was released worldwide on Deep Purple's own record company.\n- 24 Carat Purple is the first worldwide compilation album on Deep Purple's own record company and the third in a long line of Deep Purple compilation albums.",
